


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_ff58e9ec:


    "——开学典礼前夜。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_8d2dc03e:



    voice "2SA_0134"
    sachiko "「呼……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_d157413f:


    "难受地抽了口烟，然后好似叹气一样吐出烟气。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_81e6a25c:


    "——明明放手就好了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_c95270a9:



    voice "2SA_0135"
    sachiko "「啊，是狮子」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_228d54e6:



    voice "2MI_0133"
    miyako "「嗷、嗷呜～？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_6515d395:


    "迷茫的狮子。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_f5a85661:



    voice "2SA_0136"
    sachiko "「怎么了？为明天开始的学校生活感到不安？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_303adbd2:



    voice "2MI_0134"
    miyako "「才没……那个，是稍微有点担心」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_39eabee6:



    voice "2SA_0137"
    sachiko "「没关系的啦，她们也和你一起」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_8ba8b18f:



    voice "2MI_0135"
    miyako "「嗯。啊……请收下这个」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_1ac2402c:


    "狮子从口袋里拿出罐装咖啡。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_cd928315:



    voice "2SA_0138"
    sachiko "「是袋狮」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_c43b9256:


    "Thylacoleo（学名）才不是这样的。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_ad3c230a:



    voice "2SA_0139"
    sachiko "「谢……好凉！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_0494f271:


    "一碰到递给自己的饮料，祥子就发出了悲鸣。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_6585eb01:



    voice "2MI_0136"
    miyako "「自动贩卖机里只有凉的了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_a9c6c857:



    voice "2SA_0140"
    sachiko "「哦、噢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_f92c6bc5:


    "自作自受。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_d597990b:



    voice "2SA_0141"
    sachiko "「总之这罐咖啡之后再喝。你不冷吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_b4b239b2:


    "虽然穿得胖乎乎的，但穿的并不是外出用的衣服。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_2e3e94fe:



    voice "2MI_0137"
    miyako "「虽然很冷，但是这样就好」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_3a6cb5cd:


    "彻骨的寒冷对她来说也是很新鲜的吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_be7750a6:



    voice "2SA_0142"
    sachiko "「那个啊，人可是会感冒的哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_69d9672a:


    "露出了有些认真的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_2b720890:



    voice "2SA_0143"
    sachiko "「我能理解你很兴奋，但是你得习惯你已经有了一个身体哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_230e255f:


    "不管是在好的方面上来说，还是从不好的方面上来说。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_b76d5f92:



    voice "2SA_0144"
    sachiko "「一开始不就因为蛋糕吃了个苦头吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_575ccadc:



    voice "2MI_0138"
    miyako "「啊啊啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_164a15e7:


    "想起来就难受。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_4b3031fc:



    voice "2MI_0139"
    miyako "「还有很多事情要记呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_44fb4b1e:


    "说着圣夜子戴上了睡衣的兜帽。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_b6dbd5f9:



    voice "2SA_0145"
    sachiko "「然后就会一点点忘记」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_d7039378:



    voice "2MI_0140"
    miyako "「咦，会忘记吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_4c835343:



    voice "2SA_0146"
    sachiko "「Taumata？（新西兰的地名，非常之长，下同）」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_5230993a:


    "没有回答的祥子反而指着圣夜子提问。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_c47804e2:



    voice "2MI_0141"
    miyako "「whakatangihangakoaua……uo……kai……咦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_77b9bc73:


    "犹豫了一瞬间，本想继续作答。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_e74b7a2b:



    voice "2SA_0147"
    sachiko "「说不出来了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_7f7c5361:



    voice "2MI_0142"
    miyako "「这个是……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_5b516d18:


    "圣夜子点了点头，不安地看着祥子。这是想不起来理应记得的事情时的困惑。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_d508acfd:



    voice "2SA_0148"
    sachiko "「这就是人类的记忆力。我不是说了吗？毕竟有身体了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_efef8a5e:



    voice "2SA_0149"
    sachiko "「只是进入了这里而已。可不是像之前那样上传到云端」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_636ad29a:


    "说着，祥子咚咚地敲了敲自己的太阳穴。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_44ffdaee:



    voice "2SA_0150"
    sachiko "「还有啊，这并不光是容量的问题。感觉的洪水会冲走知识」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_636866a8:



    voice "2MI_0143"
    miyako "「感觉的洪水？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_ed355bfc:



    voice "2SA_0151"
    sachiko "「对。刚才你很享受一种叫做“寒冷”的“感觉”吧？这种感觉的信息量非常之大」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_ed1b4304:



    voice "2MI_0144"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_51abd331:


    "目瞪口呆。是没有理解吗。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_2711893c:



    voice "2SA_0152"
    sachiko "「对了……你试着不用寒冷这个单词来解释一下刚才你感觉到的“寒冷”这种感觉？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_4cd46f43:



    voice "2MI_0145"
    miyako "「风很凉，皮肤很疼，手指尖都麻痹了，那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_69a62031:



    voice "2SA_0153"
    sachiko "「你把你感觉到的东西都说出来了么？只是说出了一部分“感觉”吧？即便是用再多的语言也描述不出来」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_9c468e27:



    voice "2SA_0154"
    sachiko "「再举个别的例子吧。“苹果很好吃”的认知，与“苹果很好吃”的记忆，数据量差了几个数量级」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_c43e6742:



    voice "2SA_0155"
    sachiko "「“好吃”这个认知只有两个字。但是“好吃”的记忆却是用几万字都无法说清楚的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_c0286499:



    voice "2SA_0156"
    sachiko "「这种无法用语言形容的感觉，有人开始把它称为感质……这种庞大的数据量就是“感觉的洪水”」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_8c6ce991:



    voice "2SA_0157"
    sachiko "「你来到地上被各种事物感动的同时，知识也被冲刷掉了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_4e844662:



    voice "2MI_0146"
    miyako "「whakatangi……baka……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_e3038071:



    voice "2SA_0158"
    sachiko "「就像这样，本来容量就不大的脑子里的知识会在不知不觉间被替换掉」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_4945b84b:



    voice "2SA_0159"
    sachiko "「不能再像之前那样记住各种各样的事情了。会学会遗忘」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_98955e80:



    voice "2SA_0160"
    sachiko "「但是啊，感觉这种东西不像是知识那样，可以现学现卖，而只是一种实际的体验」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_8c66879e:



    voice "2SA_0161"
    sachiko "「而且，今后你要体验的是，值得用几亿年的知识来交换的东西哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_3c8b4901:



    voice "2MI_0147"
    miyako "「我的历史……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_09f039b3:



    voice "2SA_0162"
    sachiko "「三叶虫的事情，忘了也无妨吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_1d224f33:



    voice "2MI_0148"
    miyako "「啊～～」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_222e150f:


    "绷着个脸。好像本来就不感兴趣。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_04ebb589:



    voice "2SA_0163"
    sachiko "「呵呵，我重说一次吧，欢迎来到这里」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_a730128a:



    voice "2MI_0149"
    miyako "「嗯，谢谢你的邀请」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_ad91dfe6:


    "圣夜子双眼放光地盯着祥子。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_b6841879:



    voice "2SA_0164"
    sachiko "「说起来话就长了呢。差不多该——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_5d7bd919:



    voice "2MI_0150"
    miyako "「请再多说一点」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_52cccc72:



    voice "2SA_0165"
    sachiko "「哎呀～不行的哦，你穿这么少继续留在这里的话都要凉透了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_7a1e86d3:



    voice "2MI_0151"
    miyako "「我不冷……哆嗦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_9ef1823d:



    voice "2SA_0166"
    sachiko "「少骗人了。你都在发抖了。吐息也都是白色的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_21a29880:



    voice "2MI_0152"
    miyako "「呼……呼」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_3dbcd9e1:


    "圣夜子检查自己的吐息。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_045ea133:



    voice "2SA_0167"
    sachiko "「不用非得现在吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_0f2222e0:


    "祥子将烟蒂扔到便携烟灰缸里然后向圣夜子伸出手。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_51c8368f:



    voice "2MI_0153"
    miyako "「呀！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_7f376bf6:


    "祥子的手碰到脸蛋的瞬间，圣夜子发出了悲鸣。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_e2d6cc9a:



    voice "2SA_0168"
    sachiko "「啊，抱歉。是我的手太凉了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_6be754bb:



    voice "2MI_0154"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_f79fa469:


    "瞪圆了双眼。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_3e2a6efa:



    voice "2SA_0169"
    sachiko "「来，过来。一起回去吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_dddc29cd:


    "祥子拿起放在栏杆旁的快被冻住的罐装咖啡，催促道。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_8eabd2de:



    voice "2MI_0155"
    miyako "「你还会和我说这些吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_312c8fbe:


    "又死死地盯着。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_e307da0e:



    voice "2SA_0170"
    sachiko "「你的视线挺有力的啊。总感觉很有气势」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_1cd36223:



    voice "2MI_0156"
    miyako "「什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_5561e203:



    voice "2SA_0171"
    sachiko "「没什么。之后会和你说的，总之今天晚上先到这里。转学来第一天就迟到不太好吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_768e8b0f:



    voice "2MI_0157"
    miyako "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_9aa358c4:



    voice "2SA_0172"
    sachiko "「回到房间里就马上睡觉。本来你就很能睡」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_6723589f:



    voice "2MI_0158"
    miyako "「呼啊啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_89a09cad:



    voice "2SA_0173"
    sachiko "「钻到被窝里再说！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_a9663ed6:


    "祥子向着门走去，圣夜子紧随其后。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_656c6a75:


    "又被电到了。"




translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_79fbb4fe:


    "——开学典礼前夜。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_e1088c95:


    voice "2SA_0136"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_10_009d0cca:


    sachiko "「怎么了？为明天开始的校园生活感到不安？」"
